          "text": "PWM VOLTAGE PID REGULATOR \u2014 switched synchronous buck, 24 V -> 12 V\nRun 1 s at 100 kHz (dt = 10 us). PWM = 1 kHz, 100 samples / period. Double-click scopes.",
          "width": 1450,
          "height": 105,
          "font_size": 10
        }
      },
