        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "RLC plant: L=10 mH with winding resistance 0.2 ohm; C=1000 uF.\nR(t)=8+4 sin(4 pi t) ohm (4..12 ohm). Initial iL=vC=0.",
          "width": 1450,
          "height": 105,
          "font_size": 10
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "notes",
        "position": [
          3,
          75
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "MODEL: diL/dt=(24*gate - vC - 0.2*iL)/L; dvC/dt=(iL - vC/R(t))/C.\nIdeal synchronous switching permits reverse current. No diode losses, dead time or current limit.\nEuler integration; keep 100 kHz for these parameters. Voltage ripple is expected; zoom scopes to see switching.",
          "width": 1500,
          "height": 105,
          "font_size": 10
        }
      }
